The coupled mode equations are
\[
\partial_t\begin{bmatrix}T-T_0\\c-c_0\end{bmatrix}
=\partial_x^2\begin{bmatrix}
\kappa/C & n D R S T_0^2/C\\
D c_0(1-c_0)S & D
\end{bmatrix}
\begin{bmatrix}T-T_0\\c-c_0\end{bmatrix}.
\]
I’m converting the thermal coefficient to mm²/s to match the documented length and diffusivity units, and fitting \(D\) by weighted least squares against the isothermal records.
